msgstr "Gifft an, wat Du de \"XComposite-ARGB\"-Dörschienmetood bruken wullt."

#. i18n: file: app/config/yakuake.kcfg:89
#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (BackgroundColor), group (Appearance)
#: rc.cpp:227
